in, teneligliptin, and dapagliflozin; and for anti infectives that consists of ciprofloxacin HCL, diloxanide furoate, norfloxacin, and pefloxacin mesylate, as well as ticagrelor for anti platelets. It also offers drug intermediates, such as amlodipine base, s-amlodipine base, and phthaloyl amlodipine. In addition, the company is developing empagliflozin for anti-diabetics; and apixaban and rivaroxaban for anti-platelets. It also exports its products. The company was incorporated in 1989 and is headquartered in Solapur, India."}}